<p><a class=" wrap external" href="http://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//shiro-tokyo.jp/blog/1146%23%3A%7E%3Atext%3D%25E6%2587%2590%25E7%259F%25B3%25E6%2596%2599%25E7%2590%2586%25E3%2581%25AE%25E8%25B5%25B7%25E6%25BA%2590%25E3%2581%25AF%25E5%25AE%25A4%25E7%2594%25BA%25E6%2599%2582%25E4%25BB%25A3%25E3%2581%25AB%25E9%2581%25A1%25E3%2582%258A%25E3%2581%25BE%25E3%2581%2599%25E3%2580%2582%2520%25E3%2581%2593%25E3%2581%25AE%25E6%2599%2582%25E4%25BB%25A3%25E3%2581%25AB%25E8%258C%25B6%25E3%2581%25AE%25E6%25B9%25AF%25E3%2581%258C%25E9%259A%2586%25E7%259B%259B%25E3%2582%2592%25E8%25BF%258E%25E3%2581%2588%25E3%2580%2581%25E8%258C%25B6%25E9%2581%2593%25E3%2581%25A8%25E5%2585%25B1%25E3%2581%25AB%25E7%2599%25BA%25E5%25B1%2595%25E3%2581%2597%25E3%2581%259F%25E6%2596%2599%25E7%2590%2586%25E5%25BD%25A2%25E5%25BC%258F%25E3%2581%258C%25E5%25A7%258B%25E3%2581%25BE%25E3%2582%258A%25E3%2581%25A7%25E3%2581%2599%25E3%2580%2582%2520%25E5%25BD%2593%25E6%2599%2582%25E3%2581%25AE%25E6%2587%2590%25E7%259F%25B3%25E3%2581%25AF%25E3%2580%2581%25E8%258C%25B6%25E9%2581%2593%25E3%2582%2592%25E6%25A5%25BD%25E3%2581%2597%25E3%2582%2580%25E5%2589%258D%25E3%2581%25AB%25E3%2580%2581%25E7%25B0%25A1%25E7%25B4%25A0%25E3%2581%25AA%25E9%25A3%259F%25E4%25BA%258B%25E3%2581%25A8%25E3%2581%2597%25E3%2581%25A6%25E5%2587%25BA%25E3%2581%2595%25E3%2582%258C%25E3%2581%25BE%25E3%2581%2597%25E3%2581%259F%25E3%2580%2582%2520%25E8%258C%25B6%25E3%2581%25AE%25E6%25B9%25AF%25E3%2581%25AE%25E7%25B2%25BE%25E7%25A5%259E%25E3%2582%2592%25E5%258F%258D%25E6%2598%25A0%25E3%2581%2597%25E3%2581%259F%25E8%25B3%25AA%25E7%25B4%25A0%25E3%2581%25A7%25E3%2581%2582%25E3%2582%258A%25E3%2581%25AA%25E3%2581%258C%25E3%2582%2589%25E9%259B%2585%25E3%2581%25AA%25E6%2596%2599%25E7%2590%2586%25E3%2580%2581%25E3%2581%259D%25E3%2582%258C%25E3%2581%258C%25E6%2587%2590%25E7%259F%25B3%25E3%2581%25AE%25E5%25A7%258B%25E3%2581%25BE%25E3%2582%258A%25E3%2581%25A7%25E3%2581%2599%25E3%2580%2582%2C%25E5%2585%25B7%25E4%25BD%2593%25E7%259A%2584%25E3%2581%25AB%25E3%2581%25AF%25E3%2580%2581%25E7%259F%25B3%25E3%2582%2592%25E6%2587%2590%25EF%25BC%2588%25E3%2581%25B5%25E3%2581%25A8%25E3%2581%2593%25E3%2582%258D%25EF%25BC%2589%25E3%2581%25AB%25E5%2585%25A5%25E3%2582%258C%25E3%2581%259F%25E3%2581%25BB%25E3%2581%25A9%25E3%2581%25AE%25E9%2587%258F%25E3%2582%2592%25E8%25B1%25A1%25E5%25BE%25B4%25E3%2581%2599%25E3%2582%258B%25E5%25B0%258F%25E3%2581%2595%25E3%2581%25AA%25E9%25A3%25AF%25E3%2582%2584%25E6%25B1%2581%25E3%2582%2592%25E4%25B8%25AD%25E5%25BF%2583%25E3%2581%25AB%25E3%2581%2597%25E3%2581%259F%25E3%2582%2582%25E3%2581%25AE%25E3%2581%25A7%25E3%2581%2597%25E3%2581%259F%25E3%2580%2582%2520%25E3%2580%258C%25E8%2585%25B9%25E3%2582%2592%25E5%25BF%2583%25E5%259C%25B0%25E3%2582%2588%25E3%2581%258F%25E6%25B8%25A9%25E3%2582%2581%25E3%2582%258B%25E3%2580%258D%25E3%2581%25A8%25E3%2581%2584%25E3%2581%2586%25E3%2581%25AE%25E3%2581%258C%25E3%2581%259D%25E3%2581%25AE%25E7%2594%25B1%25E6%259D%25A5%25E3%2581%25A7%25E3%2581%2582%25E3%2582%258A%25E3%2580%2581%25E5%2590%258D%25E5%2589%258D%25E3%2581%25AB%25E3%2582%2582%25E8%25A1%25A8%25E3%2582%258C%25E3%2581%25A6%25E3%2581%2584%25E3%2581%25BE%25E3%2581%2599%25E3%2580%2582%2520%25E3%2581%2593%25E3%2581%2586%25E3%2581%2597%25E3%2581%25A6%25E3%2580%2581%25E5%25AE%25A4%25E7%2594%25BA%25E3%2581%258B%25E3%2582%2589%25E6%25B1%259F%25E6%2588%25B8%25E6%2599%2582%25E4%25BB%25A3%25E3%2581%25AB%25E3%2581%258B%25E3%2581%2591%25E3%2581%25A6%25E8%258C%25B6%25E3%2581%25AE%25E6%25B9%25AF%25E3%2581%25A8%25E5%2585%25B1%25E3%2581%25AB%25E9%2580%25B2%25E5%258C%2596%25E3%2581%2597%25E3%2581%25A6%25E3%2581%2584%25E3%2581%25A3%25E3%2581%259F%25E6%2587%2590%25E7%259F%25B3%25E6%2596%2599%25E7%2590%2586%25E3%2580%2582%2520%25E6%2597%25A5%25E6%259C%25AC%25E3%2581%25AE%25E9%25A3%259F%25E6%2596%2587%25E5%258C%2596%25E3%2581%25AE%25E6%25A0%25B8%25E3%2581%25A8%25E3%2581%25AA%25E3%2582%258B%25E3%2582%2582%25E3%2581%25AE%25E3%2581%25A8%25E3%2581%2597%25E3%2581%25A6%25E3%2580%2581%25E5%25A4%25A7%25E3%2581%258D%25E3%2581%25AA%25E5%25BD%25B9%25E5%2589%25B2%25E3%2582%2592%25E6%259E%259C%25E3%2581%259F%25E3%2581%2597%25E3%2581%25BE%25E3%2581%2597%25E3%2581%259F%25E3%2580%2582%2520%25E5%258D%2583%25E5%2588%25A9%25E4%25BC%2591%25E3%2581%25AE%25E5%25AD%2598%25E5%259C%25A8%25E3%2581%25AA%25E3%2581%258F%25E3%2581%2597%25E3%2581%25A6%25E3%2580%2581%25E6%2587%2590%25E7%259F%25B3%25E6%2596%2599%25E7%2590%2586%25E3%2581%25AE%25E6%25AD%25B4%25E5%258F%25B2%25E3%2581%25AF%25E8%25AA%259E%25E3%2582%258C%25E3%2581%25BE%25E3%2581%259B%25E3%2582%2593%25E3%2580%2582" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noreferrer">懐石料理の歴史｜伝統と演出の芸術を紐解く</a></p>
