<div class="question">
<h2 class="question-title">瞎扯 · 「​崩老头」​你们怎么看？</h2>

<div class="answer">

<div class="meta">
<img class="avatar" src="https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-fc734cfcc0b308e24640f9b5a2d2316d_l.jpg?source=8673f162">
<span class="author">知乎日报</span>
<a href="https://www.zhihu.com/question/None/answer/None" class="originUrl" hidden>查看知乎原文</a>
</div>

<div class="content">
<div>Q：「<a class="internal" href="https://www.zhihu.com/question/1930715810474723187/answer/2067974645215761499">崩老头</a>」<a class="internal" href="https://www.zhihu.com/question/1930715810474723187/answer/2067974645215761499">你们怎么看？</a>
<blockquote>
<div class="css-1gomreu"><a class="UserLink-link" href="https://www.zhihu.com/people/78c789de9260615a48e7ffacf78a5122" target="_blank">@牛斗之域</a></div>
：看到很多回答<br>说崩老头就是崩 90 后<br>我实名反对<br>精神小妹说了，主要崩 70 后 80 后<br>90 后也崩<br>不过 90 后崩不出来钱，很穷。</blockquote>
Q：<a class="internal" href="https://www.zhihu.com/question/2028928785739695340/answer/2042270451997696990">为什么会有人说张雪机车名字土？</a>
<blockquote>
<div class="css-1gomreu"><a class="UserLink-link" href="https://www.zhihu.com/people/1ca767a8973279fa90b3e00ef2320624" target="_blank">@艺术幻想</a></div>
：其实在美国山姆超市就跟吴老二杂货店一个意思。</blockquote>
Q：<a class="internal" href="https://www.zhihu.com/question/378849971/answer/2055236639530782786"> 天津市民有多搞笑? </a>
<blockquote>
<div class="css-1gomreu"><a class="UserLink-link" href="https://www.zhihu.com/people/9a32f8693f13af266357d2c73eddc314" target="_blank">@一身明亮</a></div>
:刚看本书，作者是<a class="RichContent-EntityWord css-b7erz1" href="https://zhida.zhihu.com/search?content_id=284490352&amp;content_type=Article&amp;match_order=1&amp;q=%E5%85%A5%E6%AE%93%E5%B8%88&amp;zhida_source=entity" target="_blank">入殓师</a>，天津这边叫大了，她是这么形容自己姥爷去世时场景的。</blockquote>
<figure>
<div class="RichText-ConditionalImagePortal"><img class="content-image" src="https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-02929f5f598ac649fc7b154e3cd99256_1440w.jpg" alt=""></div>
<figcaption> </figcaption></figure>
Q：<a class="internal" href="https://www.zhihu.com/question/1913348034005300352/answer/2016509153426842770">有什么经典的地名讹变的例子？</a>
<blockquote>
<div class="css-1gomreu"><a class="UserLink-link" href="https://www.zhihu.com/people/ae25c855364e1c5c5744556426b809e0" target="_blank">@梦装饰了谁的桥</a></div>
：别说久经战乱动荡而累积无数讹变的地名了<br>都 6202 年了<br>裸猿还能造出「人形机器人」这种鸟词</blockquote>
Q：<a class="internal" href="https://www.zhihu.com/question/2079305007262914438/answer/2080698188483375169"> GPT-6 都可以自动化电脑操作了，那我们以后是不是可以划划水、多喝点咖啡了就行了？ </a>
<blockquote>
<div class="css-1gomreu"><a class="UserLink-link" href="https://www.zhihu.com/people/569c6f8d13773fbcddfea3b6c7cbf14e" target="_blank">@粽 Chimaki</a></div>
： GPT-600 ：什么东西一点用也没有天天在这消耗小咖啡豆子和热水？刪了。</blockquote>
